WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.968
Living Things shows how technical objects detect change and preserve essential functions.

00:00:06.328 --> 00:00:14.177
In the vessel concept, a bulkhead contains flooding while backup power keeps communications and navigation available.

00:00:14.537 --> 00:00:21.593
The concrete example compares measurements, explains the test conditions and links to the original paper.

00:00:21.953 --> 00:00:28.552
Open a completed object passport to see its design, verification method and level of evidence.

00:00:28.912 --> 00:00:35.677
When you are ready, save a private draft and attach your drawings, calculations and measurements.

00:00:36.037 --> 00:00:42.760
Choose an object on the home page or open the guide. You can explore without creating an account.
